// (11, 12, 16), and the history is blended in linear light: each candidate's bicubic sample is expanded and divided by
// the previous exposure on its own, a candidate off screen (or after a reset) takes the linear colour texel, and the
// blend is scaled by the current exposure.
// DISPLAY_MV (default: not PRESET_L): the game's display-resolution motion texture (binding 12) is read when mvSize is
// set; preset L's dot2, RDNA 3 and D3D12 builds (post_l_dot2, rdna3/post_l*, post_l*.dxil) take it as M does,
// NVIDIA's L kernels have no such variant in the capture.
